{"nodes": [{"id": "apps_console_readme_openmap_console", "label": "@openmap/console", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "apps/console/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Next.js 15 App Router, React 19, Tailwind v4, TanStack Query and Virtual on the Obsidian Pro design system; reads CONSOLE_PORT via loadEnv() in scripts/next.ts and derives NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL from PUBLIC_API_URL at build time so nothing in the package names a port or URL."}, {"id": "apps_console_readme_locale_routing", "label": "Locale routing ([locale] segment)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "apps/console/README.md", "source_location": "## Locale routing", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Routes under src/app/[locale]/ validated with isLocale; layout sets html lang/dir and mounts Providers; / redirects to /<DEFAULT_LOCALE>/dashboard read at request time; middleware prefixes paths lacking a locale; switcher swaps the first segment so the same screen reopens in the other language."}, {"id": "apps_console_readme_use_t", "label": "useT / getT i18n accessors", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "apps/console/README.md", "source_location": "## Locale routing", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "apps_console_readme_theme_generation", "label": "Generated Tailwind theme (gen-theme.ts)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "apps/console/README.md", "source_location": "## Theme generation", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "src/app/theme.css is generated, not committed: scripts/gen-theme.ts writes themeCss() and stylesheet() from @openmap/ui so the console never carries raw tokens; runs in predev, prebuild and typecheck."}, {"id": "apps_console_readme_stamp_next_env", "label": "stamp-next-env.ts postbuild", "file_type": "code", "source_